# Backend Rules

- Modular Convex domains: `auth/`, `users/`, `stores/`, `products/`, `orders/`, `payments/`, `settings/`, `shared/`
- Each domain: `queries.ts`, `mutations.ts`, `helpers.ts`, `validators.ts`, `permissions.ts`
- Validate inputs with `@my-bahrain/validators` (Zod) inside handlers
- Centralize auth in `shared/permissions.ts`
- Reuse helpers from `shared/helpers.ts`

# Forbidden

- No direct permission bypass
- No hardcoded enums for business rules
- No duplicated queries
- No domain logic in `schema.ts` beyond table definitions
